# Roadmap first

Follow `.cursor/skills/roadmap/SKILL.md`.

Update `ROADMAP.md` **before** implementing a new feature or making any
other product/behavior/API change. Do not start coding `src/`, proto, or
public docs for that work while the stage (or an amended box) is missing.

**Bug fixes** that restore already-specified behavior do **not** need a
ROADMAP edit.

Do not tick a box from a verbal claim. Set **Status:** `done` only when
every box in that stage is `[x]` and the owner has reviewed.
